import{_ as n,o as i,c as o,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const d=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 282 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Absence of Causal Self-Discipline: No Reporting Mechanism for Cross-Plane Operations","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 282 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Absence of Causal Self-Discipline: No Reporting Mechanism for Cross-Plane Operations","no":282,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Causal Self-Discipline","Cross-Plane Reporting","Observe-First-Then-Interfere","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["83-Observe-First-Then-Limited-Interference Principle","87-Only-Return-Knowledge Principle","88-Cross-Plane Ethics Code"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0282_模块2-唐罗-因果自律缺失.md","filePath":"en/0282_模块2-唐罗-因果自律缺失.md"}'),s={name:"en/0282_模块2-唐罗-因果自律缺失.md"};function a(r,e,l,c,p,h){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-282-tang-luo-decomposition-absence-of-causal-self-discipline-no-reporting-mechanism-for-cross-plane-operations" tabindex="-1">Entry 282 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Absence of Causal Self-Discipline: No Reporting Mechanism for Cross-Plane Operations <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-282-tang-luo-decomposition-absence-of-causal-self-discipline-no-reporting-mechanism-for-cross-plane-operations" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 282 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Absence of Causal Self-Discipline: No Reporting Mechanism for Cross-Plane Operations&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 32)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-if-tang-luo-reaches-cross-plane-what-will-he-do" tabindex="-1">Introduction: If Tang Luo reaches cross-plane, what will he do <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-if-tang-luo-reaches-cross-plane-what-will-he-do" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: If Tang Luo reaches cross-plane, what will he do&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the causal self-discipline axiom expressly states: cross-plane operations strictly reported, observe first then limitedly interfere, only transmit knowledge back without disturbing karma. The Tang-Luo system is currently confined to a single plane, but if his ability continues growing, he will inevitably reach cross-plane. The problem: his system has prepared no reporting mechanism for cross-plane operations. This entry takes the law-first axiom as core. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Causal self-discipline absence&#39;s energy-level waste:</p><ul><li><strong>No observation habit</strong>: Tang Luo does anything as long as &quot;I think it right, I do it.&quot; He has no &quot;observe then interfere&quot; habit. Cross-plane operations by intuition easily disturb innocent karma</li><li><strong>No reporting concept</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s actions need not be reported to anyone. In his own plane, this is &quot;sage lord&#39;s freedom&quot;; stepping out of the plane, this is &quot;interference without permission&quot;</li><li><strong>No return mechanism</strong>: if Tang Luo learns new knowledge cross-plane, there is no Alaya Network to return it. Knowledge flows with his person, cannot benefit his own race</li></ul><p>Energy-level waste: cross-plane energy without reporting, observation, return is one-time consumption — done is done, no trace.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Karmic pollution</strong>: if Tang Luo by intuition interferes cross-plane, he may inadvertently alter other planes&#39; history. These changes will flow back in unpredictable ways</li><li><strong>Karmic enemies</strong>: cross-plane interference without reporting may conflict with other planes&#39; anchor civilizations. His own race makes enemies because of Tang Luo&#39;s personal behavior</li><li><strong>Knowledge waste</strong>: cross-plane learned knowledge not returned, his own race cannot benefit. Tang Luo personally gets stronger, his own race does not</li></ol><p>Regression form: the more Tang Luo personally cross-planes, the stronger he gets; his own race&#39;s civilization instead grows more fragile due to karmic pollution.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Not reporting is predation</strong>: cross-plane operations without reporting is equivalent to freely cutting on others&#39; karmic tree. This is cross-plane-scale predation</li><li><strong>Not observing is predation</strong>: interfering without observing is equivalent to operating without looking at the patient. This is disrespect to other planes&#39; life</li><li><strong>Taking without giving is predation</strong>: cross-plane only taking knowledge without returning is inter-civilizational one-way predation</li></ul><p>By the Gu Chensha / Tang Luo judgment table standard: Tang Luo = <strong>enlightened predator</strong>, when his predation form extends cross-plane, it becomes &quot;unreported interference.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Tang-Luo No Causal Self-Discipline</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Causal Self-Discipline</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>By intuition cross-plane</td><td>Observe-First-Then-Limited-Interference Principle constitutionalized</td></tr><tr><td>No reporting</td><td>Cross-plane operations strictly reported, Cross-Plane Ethics Code backstop</td></tr><tr><td>Take without giving</td><td>Only-Return-Knowledge Principle: take knowledge only, not karma</td></tr><tr><td>Karmic pollution</td><td>Time-paradox prevention mechanism + Archaeological Protocol Outline</td></tr><tr><td>Knowledge follows person</td><td>Alaya returns, knowledge shared with own race</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Alternative&#39;s crux: cross-plane is not free exploration, but rule-bound exploration. Rules are not bonds, but protection — protecting others, also protecting oneself.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: assume Tang Luo&#39;s ability grows to cross-plane level</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group A unreported cross-plane; Group B injects causal self-discipline</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: karmic-pollution event count within a hundred years, cross-plane conflict count</li><li><strong>Review expectation</strong>: Group A karmic-pollution events frequent, Group B approaches zero</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium</strong>. The Tang-Luo system is currently still on a single plane, cross-plane settings not expanded</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. If late plot needs Tang Luo cross-plane, the early &quot;single plane&quot; setting is torn; if it needs him to interfere with other planes, causal self-discipline is completely absent</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: high</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: cross-plane knowledge not returned = one-time consumption</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: unreported cross-plane interference = cross-plane predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s system made no preparation for cross-plane</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: causal self-discipline protects 99% of all planes</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: cross-plane must have rules, otherwise cross-plane chaos</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-discussion-reporting-system-for-cross-plane-operations" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Discussion: Reporting System for Cross-Plane Operations <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-discussion-reporting-system-for-cross-plane-operations" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Discussion: Reporting System for Cross-Plane Operations&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Tang-Luo system&#39;s absence of causal self-discipline, no reporting mechanism for cross-plane operations, means strong ones can freely disturb other planes&#39; karmic chains. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s alternative is cross-plane operation reporting system: any cross-plane act must first be registered on the Alaya Network, stating purpose, scope, and expected karmic impact. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s law-first axiom requires cross-plane operations to follow observe-first-then-limited-interference. The universal equal infinite law ensures the rights of beings on interfered planes are not trampled by outsiders.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>If Tang Luo stays only on his own plane, he is a good sage lord; but if he reaches cross-plane, he without causal self-discipline is a cross-plane hazard. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s causal self-discipline axiom does not bind strong ones, but lets them go farther — the precondition of going far is going by the rules.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./83-先观测后有限干涉准则.html">83-Observe-First-Then-Limited-Interference Principle</a> · <a href="./87-仅回传知识原则.html">87-Only-Return-Knowledge Principle</a> · <a href="./88-跨位面伦理准则.html">88-Cross-Plane Ethics Code</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const g=n(s,[["render",a]]);export{d as __pageData,g as default};
